  "description": "Non Material Amendment to planning permission reference 211244 granted 09/05/2022 to allow for -(&nbsp;minor changes to the full element of the&nbsp;planning permission, which granted full planning permission for multi storey car park 1. In summary, the changes proposed comprise the following:• Building level is lowered by 1m;• Cores relocated to improve travel distances;• Doors repositioned on elevations due to repositioning of cores;• Cladding to lower levels changed from precast concrete to metal cladding;• Service basement removed;• Additional filter lane added to access road;• Trees repositioned due to alterations to access road;• Future cycle path to be delivered during hospital construction; and• Provision of PVs to be delivered during hospital construction",
